#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps to use the Estimator primitive {#steps-to-use-the-estimator-primitive}"
msgstr "Mga hakbang para gamitin ang Estimator primitive {#steps-to-use-the-estimator-primitive}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. I-initialize ang account {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You first need to initialize your account. You can then select the QPU you want to use to calculate the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "Kailangan mo munang i-initialize ang iyong account. Maaari kang pumili ng QPU na gusto mong gamitin para kalkulahin ang expectation value.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow the steps in the [Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup) if you don't already have an account.\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga hakbang sa [I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup) kung wala ka pang account.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga fractional gate\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use the newly supported [fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates), set `use_fractional_gates=True` when requesting a backend from a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance. For example:\n"
msgstr "Para gamitin ang bagong sinusuportahang [mga fractional gate](/guides/fractional-gates), itakda ang `use_fractional_gates=True` kapag humihiling ng backend mula sa isang `QiskitRuntimeService` instance. Halimbawa:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is an experimental feature and might change in the future.\n"
msgstr "Ito ay isang experimental na feature at maaaring magbago sa hinaharap.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Create a circuit and an observable {#2-create-a-circuit-and-an-observable}"
msgstr "2. Lumikha ng circuit at isang observable {#2-create-a-circuit-and-an-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You need at least one circuit and one observable as inputs to the Estimator primitive.\n"
msgstr "Kailangan mo ng kahit isang circuit at isang observable bilang mga input sa Estimator primitive.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuit and observable need to be transformed to only use instructions supported by the QPU (referred to as *instruction set architecture (ISA)* circuits). Use the transpiler to do this.\n"
msgstr "Ang circuit at observable ay kailangang i-transform para gumamit lamang ng mga instruction na sinusuportahan ng QPU (tinatawag na *instruction set architecture (ISA)* circuit). Gamitin ang transpiler para gawin ito.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Initialize the IBM Quantum Estimator {#3-initialize-the-ibm-quantum-estimator}"
msgstr "3. I-initialize ang IBM Quantum Estimator {#3-initialize-the-ibm-quantum-estimator}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you initialize Estimator, use the `mode` parameter to specify the mode you want it to run in.  Possible values are `batch`, `session`, or `backend` objects for batch, session, and job execution mode, respectively. For more information, see [Introduction to IBM Quantum Compute Service execution modes](/guides/execution-modes). Note that Open Plan users cannot submit session jobs.\n"
msgstr "Kapag ini-initialize mo ang Estimator, gamitin ang parameter na `mode` para tukuyin ang mode na gusto mong patakbuhin nito. Ang mga posibleng halaga ay mga object na `batch`, `session`, o `backend` para sa batch, session, at job execution mode, ayon sa pagkakasunod. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan ang [Panimula sa IBM Quantum Compute Service execution modes](/guides/execution-modes). Tandaan na ang mga gumagamit ng Open Plan ay hindi makakapagsumite ng mga session job.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Invoke Estimator and get results {#4-invoke-estimator-and-get-results}"
msgstr "4. I-invoke ang Estimator at makuha ang mga resulta {#4-invoke-estimator-and-get-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, invoke the `run()` method to calculate expectation values for the input circuits and observables. The circuit, observable, and optional parameter value sets are input as *primitive unified bloc* (PUB) tuples.\n"
msgstr "Susunod, i-invoke ang method na `run()` para kalkulahin ang mga expectation value para sa mga input na circuit at observable. Ang circuit, observable, at mga opsyonal na set ng halaga ng parameter ay inilalagay bilang mga tuple ng *primitive unified bloc* (PUB).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn how to [test locally](local-testing-mode) before running on quantum computers.\n"
"- Review detailed [examples](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile/) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) guide.\n"
"- Learn how to [use the primitive options](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- View the API for [Estimator](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) options.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- Alamin kung paano [subukan nang lokal](local-testing-mode) bago patakbuhin sa mga quantum computer.\n"
"- Suriin ang mga detalyadong [halimbawa](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Magsanay sa mga primitive sa pamamagitan ng paggawa ng [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) sa IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Alamin kung paano mag-transpile nang lokal sa seksyon ng [Transpile](/guides/transpile/).\n"
"- Subukan ang gabay na [Ihambing ang mga setting ng transpiler](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings).\n"
"- Alamin kung paano [gamitin ang mga opsyon ng primitive](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Tingnan ang API para sa mga opsyon ng [Estimator](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
